seg-dd68e234a5cd = SGP4/SDP4 validation against the community reference

# text
# c1: SGP4-VER.TLE
# c2: tcppver.out
seg-d7567fa218fe = Kshana's orbit propagator is validated against the <b>canonical community reference</b> for SGP4/SDP4 (SGP4: Simplified General Perturbations { "4" }; SDP4: Simplified Deep-space Perturbations { "4" }): the verification vectors published with Vallado et al., <em>"Revisiting Spacetrack Report #3"</em> (AIAA (American Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics) 2006-6753), distributed as <c1/> (the test TLEs (two-line element sets)) and <c2/> (the expected TEME (true equator, mean equinox) state at each time). This is the same reference the public C++/Python/MATLAB implementations validate against, so agreement here is agreement with the de-facto standard.

