seg-ebc18c4cb8ad = The test (<c1/>) parses the vendored <c2/> and <c3/> fixtures (<c4/>), propagates each test satellite to every reference time, and asserts the TEME position and velocity match within the tolerances above. The compared-row count is pinned at exactly <c5/> so a fixture or skip-behaviour regression cannot quietly reduce coverage.

